        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105274?u=173310b843e2751843265438af8cfb79eda02039&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Adds <code class=\"notranslate\">api.EXT_polygon_offset_clamp</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">api.EXT_polygon_offset_clamp.polygonOffsetClampEXT</code>: Chrome 122, Firefox 158, Safari 17.4, the rest mirrored</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Firefox 158: available by default in WebGL 1 and WebGL 2 contexts: <a href=\"https://bugzil.la/1854003\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzil.la/1854003</a></li>\n<li>Chrome 122: available by default: <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/chromium/chromium/commit/0c83005fec36/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/chromium/chromium/commit/0c83005fec36\">chromium/chromium@<tt>0c83005fec36</tt></a></li>\n<li>Safari 17.4: available by default: <a href=\"https://commits.webkit.org/270382@main\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://commits.webkit.org/270382@main</a></li>\n<li>Tested in Firefox Nightly 159: <code class=\"notranslate\">getExtension()</code> returns the extension on WebGL 1 and WebGL 2 contexts, and <code class=\"notranslate\">polygonOffsetClampEXT()</code> sets <code class=\"notranslate\">POLYGON_OFFSET_CLAMP_EXT</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5617203474\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45888\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/45888/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45888\">mdn/content#45888</a></li>\n</ul>",
