        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185269030?u=1fc22565ccf4566b6f734fabaa87e03d9a31cfe4&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #30474.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5418797612\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30474\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30474/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30474\">#30474</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;dialog closedby=\"any\"&gt;</code> has a touch event propagation bug in Chrome 134–153<br>\nand Firefox 141+: tapping the backdrop closes the dialog but does not cancel<br>\nthe event, causing click listeners on elements behind the backdrop to fire.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Changes:</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Chrome: converted to array — clean entry for 154+ (fixed via<br>\n<a href=\"https://crbug.com/425579196\" rel=\"nofollow\">bug 425579196</a>), plus a 134–153 entry with a note</li>\n<li>Firefox: added <code class=\"notranslate\">notes</code> to the 141+ entry linking to<br>\n<a href=\"https://bugzil.la/2022750\" rel=\"nofollow\">bug 2022750</a> (still unfixed as of Firefox 156)</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">chrome_android</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">edge</code>, and <code class=\"notranslate\">firefox_android</code> correctly mirror their<br>\ndesktop entries — no additional changes needed</li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30834",
            "title": "fix(html): add notes for dialog closedby=any touch propagation bug",
            "date_modified": "2026-10-10T22:06:18.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-10-10T22:05:37.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "BHUVANSH855",
                "url": "https://github.com/BHUVANSH855"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185269030?u=1fc22565ccf4566b6f734fabaa87e03d9a31cfe4&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #30831.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5795287046\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30831\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30831/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30831\">#30831</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Adds three missing Permission Policy directive entries to <code class=\"notranslate\">html.elements.iframe.allow</code>:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">local-network</code>: Chrome 145, Firefox 153, <code class=\"notranslate\">experimental: false</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">loopback-network</code>: Chrome 145, Firefox 153, <code class=\"notranslate\">experimental: false</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">local-network-access</code>: Chrome 142, Firefox false, <code class=\"notranslate\">experimental: true</code> (legacy alias, superseded by the two above)</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Firefox support verified via Bugzilla bug <a href=\"https://bugzil.la/1978550\" rel=\"nofollow\">1978550</a> (RESOLVED FIXED); <code class=\"notranslate\">network.lna.blocking</code> defaults to true from the Firefox 153 release tag.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Note: <code class=\"notranslate\">http.headers.Permissions-Policy</code> entries for these directives correctly remain <code class=\"notranslate\">false</code> — Firefox has not implemented HTTP header parsing for Permissions-Policy (bug <a href=\"https://bugzil.la/1531012\" rel=\"nofollow\">1531012</a> is still open).</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30833",
            "title": "html/elements/iframe: add local-network, local-network-access, and loopback-network allow directives",
            "date_modified": "2026-10-10T21:26:55.000Z",
