            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349114?u=1185d4fc45f5ff4c4a592b30a4dd2bb5cd1b7128&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #24191.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2477468700\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/24191\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/24191/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/24191\">#24191</a></p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://css-tricks.com/yay-for-hsla/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://css-tricks.com/yay-for-hsla/</a></p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Was added to the collector in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5544471678\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/openwebdocs/mdn-bcd-collector/issues/3402\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/openwebdocs/mdn-bcd-collector/pull/3402/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/openwebdocs/mdn-bcd-collector/pull/3402\">openwebdocs/mdn-bcd-collector#3402</a></p>",
