        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349114?u=1185d4fc45f5ff4c4a592b30a4dd2bb5cd1b7128&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Safari 27.2 beta supports <a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-forms-1/#selectordef-field-content\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://drafts.csswg.org/css-forms-1/#selectordef-field-content</a>.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Discovered with the OWD Collector project v10.20.15.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Seems to have landed with <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5274862586\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/issues/72680\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/WebKit/WebKit/pull/72680/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/pull/72680\">WebKit/WebKit#72680</a></p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">None.</p>",
